(b)(1) (1) ISO/IEC 15459-2, which is incorporated by reference at § 830.10;
(b)(2) (2) ISO/IEC 15459-4, which is incorporated by reference at § 830.10; and
(b)(3) (3) ISO/IEC 15459-6, which is incorporated by reference at § 830.10.
(c) (c) Use only characters and numbers from the invariant character set of ISO/IEC 646, which is incorporated by reference at § 830.10.

